        "content": "<p>I'm working on a setup where the specs of my functions are defined in one place, and proven in another. Typically,  this would look like this : </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">spec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌜</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌝</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⇓</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌜</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌝</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- some other place</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">spec</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">spec</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">proof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">spec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mvcgen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This works fine, but not If I try to use <code>level.spec.proof</code> latter on : </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌜</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">True</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌝</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">⦃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⇓</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌜</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">False</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⌝</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⦄</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mvcgen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- stuck on foo</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>It seems that putting the <code>spec</code> attribute does indeed register the theorem, but then <code>mvcgen</code> cannot use it. Unfolding foo is not an option for me, I want to reuse the specs I've already proven. Using <code>mvcgen [foo.spec.proof]</code> directly does not work either.</p>\n<p>Am I doing something wrong here ? Is there a known workaround? :) (maybe <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"130195\">@Sebastian Graf</span> ?) </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://live.lean-lang.org/#codez=JYWwDg9gTgLgBAZRgEwHQBUCGBjGxuoAiEAUBGAKYB2iKRpJyFAZnMxBHAFxwCSycAHKZ4XALxwwAVygU4ABhKYARstkA3Nh1QBnStm4S4gYMo4gHGI46KFLmBcYjiAQyi2dTgZcI4UOGIB85y9btHOBISAAEAbT0KbABdEhgACwpoChBnXX1UMCgOVh52CAzowzhlAE84EHVsAHNqOHCCuJIKAA9McAAbOR4SOBM%2FKxs4eyc%2BuGRObvhWuEAEwmcAbkkZOQAKWYBqOABGAEpg%2FrcPL18LADFMTp1Ap3FSivGq2vqAWle4HRgpbABrOAgNAKh0%2B0CgFSAA&amp;project=mathlib-v4.28.0\">Minimized example on the playground</a></p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
